  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T X.674 provides for the registration of object identifier (OID) arcs which enable identification of different kinds of alerts and alerting agencies. This Recommendation specifies the information and justification to be provided when requesting anOID for alerting purposes, and the procedures for the operation of the Registration Authority.</abstract>
